    "detailed_description": "<h1>GEAR UP WITH REAL BRANDS</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b22d9d7510e726dd72960f1f0a701ed5.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/0101da251622458a792fd4f71104550a.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Major League Fishing\u00ae: Pro Catch -\u00a0</strong>the ultimate fishing adventure that blends lifelike simulation with thrilling competition. Whether you're an elite angler or a weekend hobbyist, get ready to experience the most immersive fishing sim ever made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/ee679eedd9efec539a94a6d9ccd8aca8.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip yourself with authentic gear from <strong>Mossy Oak\u00ae, Abu Garcia\u00ae, Fenwick\u00ae, Hardy\u00ae, Pflueger\u00ae, Greys\u00ae, Berkley\u00ae, Duckett Fishing\u00ae, Lew's\u00ae, Strike King\u00ae, Zebco\u00ae</strong>\u00a0and more. Customize rods, reels, baits, and tackle boxes to match your style. Upgrade your boat and sonar to gain the competitive edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/5b140ac32e5568c7d870a12f8d484262.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel across the globe, from crystal-clear alpine lakes to deep-sea fishing hotspots. Every location features stunning visuals, dynamic weather, and ecosystems filled with realistic fish behavior and hidden gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b421dcafecab7753434797b665978c3a.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bass, trout, marlin, and monstrous deep-sea predators- every fish is a challenge. With different fish AI and behaviors, each catch is always a challenge! Sharpen your technique and master the art of fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/5f3f3d14cfeb41896a6779ed977c4bff.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chill in solo mode or join global multiplayer tournaments. Compete with friends, share your biggest catches, or climb the online leaderboards as part of your fishing crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b620e26e2aefc83ef3efdcbb5d3b1d28.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With realistic environments, responsive casting, and a full day-night cycle, <strong>MLF: Pro Catch</strong> offers a satisfying blend of hardcore realism and arcade-style fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/9401b2ffe6269ce77d24bcb25410f749.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019ve got what it takes? Join fast-paced, skill-based tournaments for a shot at <strong>real-world rewards</strong>\u00a0- exclusive gear, leaderboard glory, and bragging rights. It\u2019s easy to enter, tough to master, and always worth the fight.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/0101da251622458a792fd4f71104550a.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Major League Fishing\u00ae: Pro Catch -\u00a0</strong>the ultimate fishing adventure that blends lifelike simulation with thrilling competition. Whether you're an elite angler or a weekend hobbyist, get ready to experience the most immersive fishing sim ever made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/ee679eedd9efec539a94a6d9ccd8aca8.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip yourself with authentic gear from <strong>Mossy Oak\u00ae, Abu Garcia\u00ae, Fenwick\u00ae, Hardy\u00ae, Pflueger\u00ae, Greys\u00ae, Berkley\u00ae, Duckett Fishing\u00ae, Lew's\u00ae, Strike King\u00ae, Zebco\u00ae</strong>\u00a0and more. Customize rods, reels, baits, and tackle boxes to match your style. Upgrade your boat and sonar to gain the competitive edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/5b140ac32e5568c7d870a12f8d484262.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel across the globe, from crystal-clear alpine lakes to deep-sea fishing hotspots. Every location features stunning visuals, dynamic weather, and ecosystems filled with realistic fish behavior and hidden gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b421dcafecab7753434797b665978c3a.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bass, trout, marlin, and monstrous deep-sea predators- every fish is a challenge. With different fish AI and behaviors, each catch is always a challenge! Sharpen your technique and master the art of fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/5f3f3d14cfeb41896a6779ed977c4bff.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chill in solo mode or join global multiplayer tournaments. Compete with friends, share your biggest catches, or climb the online leaderboards as part of your fishing crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/b620e26e2aefc83ef3efdcbb5d3b1d28.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With realistic environments, responsive casting, and a full day-night cycle, <strong>MLF: Pro Catch</strong> offers a satisfying blend of hardcore realism and arcade-style fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307150/extras/9401b2ffe6269ce77d24bcb25410f749.avif?t=1750160473\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019ve got what it takes? Join fast-paced, skill-based tournaments for a shot at <strong>real-world rewards</strong>\u00a0- exclusive gear, leaderboard glory, and bragging rights. It\u2019s easy to enter, tough to master, and always worth the fight.</p>",
    "short_description": "Cast, catch, and compete in the most immersive fishing sim ever made. Explore legendary waters, battle over 40 unique fish species, customize real gear, and climb the leaderboards in online tournaments with real-world prizes.",
